{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2021-11-11 01:00:00', 'title': 'NYFIX ORDER ROUTING NETWORK WINS "BEST LOW LATENCY" PRIZE FROM WATERSTECHNOLOGY\'S BUY-SIDE TECHNOLOGY AWARDS 2021', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NOV. 11,\xa02021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 BROADRIDGE FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS, INC. \xa0(NYSE: BR),\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS NYFIX ORDER ROUTING NETWORK FROM ITIVITI WAS NAMED "BEST LOW LATENCY TRADING NETWORK" FOR THE SECOND CONSECUTIVE YEAR AT THE\xa0WATERS TECHNOLOGY\'S\xa0BUY-SIDE TECHNOLOGY (BST) AWARDS 2021.\xa0THIS WIN MARKS THE FIFTH TIME IN THE PAST SIX YEARS NYFIX FROM ITIVITI HAS TAKEN HOME A PRESTIGIOUS BST AWARD.'}